<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Northern Fury 42 - Blast from the Past</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;Northern Fury 42 – Blast from the Past&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;20 March 1994, 2200 Zulu, 2300 Local&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;The new global war between East and West has been raging for over a month, NATO is on the offensive but the Warsaw Pact is far from defeated and still has the ability to counter attack.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;The ground war in Europe continues to be brutal and deadly, after Berlin and Copenhagen fell, the Danish Government collapsed but the Germans continue to govern out of Bonn. Danish air and naval forces are generally still fighting alongside NATO counterparts but they have taken heavy casualties. Aircraft losses in central Europe count in the thousands, troops in the tens of thousands on both sides. Over 100 ships and patrol vessels have been sunk in the Baltic alone. Conflicts in the Caribbean, Mediterranean, Persian Gulf and Indian Ocean have stabilized in NATO’s favour, both the Panama and Suez Canals remain open and navigable. In the Pacific, 7&lt;SUP&gt;th&lt;/SUP&gt; Fleet has opened a corridor to Japan through the Philippines and Taiwan.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;South Korea is still under constant air threat but some supply and reinforcements, heavily escorted have reached Busan.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;USS Constellation has retired to San Diego after sustaining heavy losses amongst her air group, which is now operating out of Clark Field.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;USS New Jersey was struck by 3 torpedoes but limped to Manila where it remains tied up, unlikely to put to sea again.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN style="mso-ansi-language: EN"&gt;Strike Fleet Atlantic (STRIKFLTLANT) is now in the second phase of its counter attack in the Atlantic.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;Fighting on Iceland is wrapping up with only minor pockets of resistance remaining. NATO now has air superiority over most of Norway but the Soviets are able to contest that if the object is worth the casualties&lt;/SPAN&gt;.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;Commander &lt;SPAN lang=EN style="mso-ansi-language: EN"&gt;STRIKFLTLANT has set in motion a series of attacks designed set up the conditions for upcoming amphibious operations in central Norway. Tonight’s activity is aimed at deceiving him as to where that operation will be.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;This scenario is playable by NATO:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"&gt;You are commanding the USS Wisconsin Task Group&lt;/B&gt; and are charged with destroying several coastal fortress that were built by the Norwegians to fend off an attack from the sea. The Soviets are now manning these guns and have expended a reasonable amount of ammunition to become proficient with them. You also need to insert a Special Forces team undetected into the mountains near the Swedish border – but most of all you need to convince the Soviets that we are very interested in this area.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;-----------------------------------------------------&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;Designer’s Notes:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;This is the 42nd scenario of a 58 scenario campaign. See the Northern Fury background document for further insight on the background and happenings so far. The key nuggets&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 36pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18.15pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Symbol"&gt;· &lt;/SPAN&gt;Cold War continued, no thaw in relations. WP still alive and doing very well. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 36pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18.15pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Symbol"&gt;· &lt;/SPAN&gt;The 3&lt;SUP&gt;rd&lt;/SUP&gt; World war started 13 Feb. The Warsaw Pact forces led by the Soviet Union attacked NATO and other nations on a global scale. The main blow was in Western Europe but fighting erupted in the Pacific, Caribbean, Middle East and North Africa.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;India has declared a separate war with Pakistan, North Korea attacked Southwards in an apparently independent move and Argentina is threatening the Falklands again (but has not attacked).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;In earlier scenarios to this battle set, you found that the defences in North Norway collapsed; the Soviet Northern Fleet has put to sea; and Soviet submarines are inflicting damage along the US Eastern seaboard. Iceland fell into Soviet hands, and they attempted to interdict the Sea and Air Lines of Communications between North America and Europe. The 2&lt;SUP&gt;nd&lt;/SUP&gt; Fleet (US) and &lt;SPAN lang=EN style="mso-ansi-language: EN"&gt;Strike Fleet Atlantic (2&lt;SUP&gt;nd&lt;/SUP&gt; Fleet + NATO forces) heavily supported by USAF and RAF elements have largely retaken Iceland. A recent Soviet offensive in Norway has been halted but casualties were high. NATO has now retaking the offensive and is preparing for a major operation to seize Norway.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 35.85pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: OpenSymbol; mso-fareast-font-family: OpenSymbol; mso-bidi-font-family: OpenSymbol"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;•&lt;SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;Please respect the initial ready times for aircraft, this represents designed delays that both balance the scenario and paint the picture of the ongoing conflict.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 35.85pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: OpenSymbol; mso-fareast-font-family: OpenSymbol; mso-bidi-font-family: OpenSymbol"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;•&lt;SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;Points are allotted or deducted for losses, achieving special missions and completing objectives. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Textbody0 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 6pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Textbody0 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 6pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"&gt;Created by Bart Gauvin: AKA Gunner98&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
